{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30247","headline":"元日楼前观仗 二 · 薛逢","name":"元日楼前观仗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曈曈初日照楼台，漠漠祥云雉扇开。\n星驻冕旒三殿晓，云翻珠翠六宫来。\n山呼圣寿烟霞动，风转金章鸟兽回。\n欲识普恩无远近，万方欢忭一声雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}